{"metadata":{"title":"A Starting Guide (Sessions)","modules":[{"name":"IssuingSDKDocs"}],"role":"article","roleHeading":"Article"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Integrate the Adyen Issuing SDK into your iOS application."}],"kind":"article","primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The Adyen Issuing SDK provides a suite of features for managing payment instruments in your iOS app:"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Card Provisioning Sessions","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" — Add payment cards to Apple Wallet","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Card Sessions","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" — Securely reveal card details (PAN, CVC, expiry), reveal PIN, and change PIN (Work in Progress)"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This guide covers the common setup steps required for all SDK features."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Prerequisites","anchor":"Prerequisites"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Before you begin, you must obtain a certificate from Adyen. This certificate is required to initialize the SDK."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Embed-the-Certificate","text":"Embed the Certificate"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Take the certificate provided by Adyen and embed it directly into your app’s main bundle.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Fetch-a-Session-Token","text":"Fetch a Session Token"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"All SDK features require a session token from the Adyen API. Your backend needs to fetch this token for the specific payment instruments."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfo